# Credential Health Log

Append-only ledger of provider credential probes. Both Evolution and
the human operator may write here. Use this to track provider auth
status over time.

## Format
```
[<ISO8601>] | <provider>=<status> | detail=<method or note>
```

Status values:
- `200` — authenticated probe succeeded
- `401` — token rejected; re-auth required
- `403` — token valid but lacks scope
- `429` — rate limit; backoff
- `SKIP` — probe not run (e.g. no auth file, provider not configured)
- `N/A` — provider not in use

## Examples
```
[2026-01-01T00:00:00+00:00] | provider_x=200 | detail=probe_via_bearer
[2026-01-01T00:05:00+00:00] | provider_x=401 | detail=token_expired_re_auth_needed
```
